      "side": 1,
      "message": "It seems like you could allow:\n```\n    [sx kx 0 tx]\n    [ky sy 0 ty]\n    [*  *  * * ]\n    [0  0  0 1 ]\n```\nthrough to here even if there was an API that allowed setting local z to something other than 0 (and *\u0027s in the rest of the third column if not) unless you plan to do something with the \"device space\" z value. Otherwise clients that have a z-transform will lose all the rrect optimizations, right?",
      "revId": "e3eb9b7d0c34242d776e2e2bc6327e521878817c",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
