      "writtenOn": "2024-01-25T20:08:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Which rrect optimizations are you thinking of? Graphite\u0027s rrect renderer doesn\u0027t care about the transform type.\n\nI opted not to let orthographic transforms get lower because of their impact on calculating the inverse matrix. In coverage mask/text draws we have to map by the inverse to get the local coords and I\u0027ll need to re-review to see whether or not they could get away with this simplification.",
      "parentUuid": "5c6e9216_4a154c91",
      "revId": "e3eb9b7d0c34242d776e2e2bc6327e521878817c",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
